; The independent allocation checker: from the selected program it derives
; the values each use expects; from the allocated program the locations each
; instruction actually reads and writes; and it reconciles them by symbolic
; dataflow through joins and loops. It never imports the allocator, whose
; reports are witnesses to check, not facts to trust. See the Machine IR
; design in .ai/.

(library
 (name machine_check)
 (libraries core err_trace fmt machine_ir))
